          "blockId": "spya-qx90p6",
          "kind": "explain",
          "text": "The worry: even if mind and brain state must go together, we can still picture one without the other, so the link looks accidental.",
          "quote": "Kripke's problem of explaining why it nevertheless appears contingent",
          "to": null,
          "toQuote": null
        },
        {
          "blockId": "spya-d7dvns",
          "kind": "explain",
          "text": "Lightning's nature can be studied without sight, so we can drop the human viewpoint and still study the same thing.",
          "quote": "it has a more objective character than is revealed in its visual appearance",
          "to": null,
          "toQuote": null
        }
      ],
